    "detailed_description": "It all starts with a body. It always does. Your task: crack the case and determine what happened. The last few years haven't been great for you. You were meant to investigate high-profile cases and bask in the spotlight as the colony\u2019s best detective. Instead of being at the top, you\u2019re actually closer to rock bottom. Still, you can be of use to someone - to people, to androids. Fortunately, fame and fortune don\u2019t matter all that much to you. When someone is found in a dark alley, it is the Detective\u2019s duty to investigate it. In that regard, not much has changed in centuries. It\u2019s what you do. It\u2019s what you\u2019re good at. After all, in order to fall from the top, you have to get there first.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/81280d8f390092582c7d3212bf3d4b6f.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/81280d8f390092582c7d3212bf3d4b6f.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/81280d8f390092582c7d3212bf3d4b6f.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Intricate Clue System</strong><br>Not everything you find will help you solve the case. Navigate red herrings and false leads to uncover the truth. Remember, the truth is out there, ready to be uncovered. You just have to know where to look.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/0c86176fc17ff916d603db19fd339ddf.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/0c86176fc17ff916d603db19fd339ddf.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/0c86176fc17ff916d603db19fd339ddf.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Unique Cyberpunk-Victorian Atmosphere</strong><br>Visit a British colony on Mars, where neon-lit streets and Victorian elegance conceal corruption and misery of those who inhabit it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/9eaa5e07ee19437f4da8466705a1f882.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/9eaa5e07ee19437f4da8466705a1f882.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/9eaa5e07ee19437f4da8466705a1f882.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dynamic Detective Board</strong><br>Find and connect evidence, answer questions by analyzing clues and crack the case using an intuitive detective board.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/a6f0c71e6dee7d62f0a2c423f0341e97.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/a6f0c71e6dee7d62f0a2c423f0341e97.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/a6f0c71e6dee7d62f0a2c423f0341e97.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Engaging Detective Mechanics</strong><br>Immersive investigative mechanics allow you to put your deduction skills to the test. Analyze evidence, reconstruct events, scan your surroundings and reveal what\u2019s hidden.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/8805c5d79edd60048c456e11eb74917d.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/8805c5d79edd60048c456e11eb74917d.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/8805c5d79edd60048c456e11eb74917d.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dark and Mysterious Crimes</strong><br>Step into the shadows of a world filled with brutal, enigmatic crimes. Whispered tales of a techno-vampire haunt the streets \u2014 can this be true or is it merely a scary bedtime story? Every mystery you unravel draws you deeper into a tangled web of secrets and looming threats.<br><br>You must keep a sharp eye, examine your surroundings and study the clues. Individual ones may seem meaningless, but pieced together, they will bring you closer to getting the answers you\u2019re after. Trust no one, question everything.<br><br>So, how about it? Wanna take the case? Walk into the alley behind the Dance Hall and see where the first case takes you.",
    "about_the_game": "It all starts with a body. It always does. Your task: crack the case and determine what happened. The last few years haven't been great for you. You were meant to investigate high-profile cases and bask in the spotlight as the colony\u2019s best detective. Instead of being at the top, you\u2019re actually closer to rock bottom. Still, you can be of use to someone - to people, to androids. Fortunately, fame and fortune don\u2019t matter all that much to you. When someone is found in a dark alley, it is the Detective\u2019s duty to investigate it. In that regard, not much has changed in centuries. It\u2019s what you do. It\u2019s what you\u2019re good at. After all, in order to fall from the top, you have to get there first.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/81280d8f390092582c7d3212bf3d4b6f.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/81280d8f390092582c7d3212bf3d4b6f.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/81280d8f390092582c7d3212bf3d4b6f.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Intricate Clue System</strong><br>Not everything you find will help you solve the case. Navigate red herrings and false leads to uncover the truth. Remember, the truth is out there, ready to be uncovered. You just have to know where to look.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/0c86176fc17ff916d603db19fd339ddf.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/0c86176fc17ff916d603db19fd339ddf.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/0c86176fc17ff916d603db19fd339ddf.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Unique Cyberpunk-Victorian Atmosphere</strong><br>Visit a British colony on Mars, where neon-lit streets and Victorian elegance conceal corruption and misery of those who inhabit it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/9eaa5e07ee19437f4da8466705a1f882.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/9eaa5e07ee19437f4da8466705a1f882.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/9eaa5e07ee19437f4da8466705a1f882.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dynamic Detective Board</strong><br>Find and connect evidence, answer questions by analyzing clues and crack the case using an intuitive detective board.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/a6f0c71e6dee7d62f0a2c423f0341e97.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/a6f0c71e6dee7d62f0a2c423f0341e97.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/a6f0c71e6dee7d62f0a2c423f0341e97.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Engaging Detective Mechanics</strong><br>Immersive investigative mechanics allow you to put your deduction skills to the test. Analyze evidence, reconstruct events, scan your surroundings and reveal what\u2019s hidden.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/8805c5d79edd60048c456e11eb74917d.poster.avif?t=1750924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/8805c5d79edd60048c456e11eb74917d.webm?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324400/extras/8805c5d79edd60048c456e11eb74917d.mp4?t=1750924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dark and Mysterious Crimes</strong><br>Step into the shadows of a world filled with brutal, enigmatic crimes. Whispered tales of a techno-vampire haunt the streets \u2014 can this be true or is it merely a scary bedtime story? Every mystery you unravel draws you deeper into a tangled web of secrets and looming threats.<br><br>You must keep a sharp eye, examine your surroundings and study the clues. Individual ones may seem meaningless, but pieced together, they will bring you closer to getting the answers you\u2019re after. Trust no one, question everything.<br><br>So, how about it? Wanna take the case? Walk into the alley behind the Dance Hall and see where the first case takes you.",
    "short_description": "Step into the shoes of an old-school detective in a neon-lit Victorian city, where ornate buildings conceal dark secrets and the depths of human depravity. Connect the dots and unravel the mystery. Is there any truth to the legends of notorious technovampires? Trust no one. Question everything.",
